WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:07.507
Even if you don't have time, I do!

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.270
Are you stupid?

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.147
Don't get in my way.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.277
They say you're a really good person.

00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:31.448
When Asagiri and Yukikaze talk about you,

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.992
they show kind eyes
they usually never show.

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:37.787
Nostalgia, is it called?
They sometimes laugh, too.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:39.789
I hate that.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:45.795
I really hate it. When they talk about
something I don't know.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.340
I always feel that it's really disgusting.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:53.303
I think about how I'd hate it
if this feeling continued.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.341
I'll kill you!

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:56.616
That's...

